%%{init: {"sequence": {"htmlLabels": false}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    participant SND as Sender
    participant NET as Network (UDP)
    participant FA as FragmentAssembler
    participant APP as Application

    Note over SND: build_fragmented_bundle(bundle)\nFRAGMENT_BODY_SIZE = 1300 bytes\nN = ceil(total / 1300)\nfrag_begin = first seq_id\nfrag_end = frag_begin + N - 1

    SND->>NET: frag[0] flags=RELIABLE|FRAGMENTED|HAS_SEQ\nseq_id=frag_begin, frag_begin=X, frag_end=X+N-1\nbody=1300 bytes + acks (only first frag carries acks)
    NET->>FA: process_parsed(seq_id=X, frag_begin=X, frag_end=X+N-1)
    Note over FA: key = frag_begin = X\nidx = seq_id - frag_begin = 0\ntotal = frag_end - frag_begin + 1 = N\nstore buf[0] = body

    SND->>NET: frag[1] seq_id=X+1, same frag_begin/frag_end
    NET->>FA: process_parsed(seq_id=X+1)
    Note over FA: idx=1, store buf[1]

    SND->>NET: frag[N-1] seq_id=X+N-1
    NET->>FA: process_parsed(seq_id=X+N-1)
    Note over FA: idx=N-1, all slots filled\nconcatenate buf[0..N-1]\nremove PendingMessage from HashMap

    FA->>APP: reassembled body (complete bundle)

    Note over FA: Stale cleanup: FRAGMENT_REASSEMBLY_TIMEOUT_MS=30,000ms\ncleanup_stale() called each Nub tick()